DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20200320
SUMMARY:[Maine Agencies] Superintendent LaFountain notifies financial inst
 itutions of new FAME Loan Guarantee Program for borrowers affected by COVI
 D-19
DESCRIPTION:Superintendent LaFountain notifies financial institutions of n
 ew FAME Loan Guarantee Program for borrowers affected by COVID-19\nMar 20\
 , 2020\nGARDINER – Superintendent Lloyd LaFountain of the Maine Bureau
  of Financial Institutions announced today that Maine’s banks and credi
 t unions may participate in a new lending program administered by the Fin
 ance Authority of Maine (FAME) aimed at providing assistance to eligible b
 orrowers affected by COVID-19.\nThe Loan Guarantee Program was established
  by the Legislature in recently enacted emergency legislation related to C
 OVID-19. The legislation included a new consumer loan guarantee program\, 
 the\nCOVID-19 Relief Consumer Loan Program\n\, which is administered by FA
 ME in partnership with Maine financial institutions. It will provide a lim
 ited number of no-to low-interest consumer loans through a loan guarantee 
 program involving Maine’s banks\, credit unions\, and FAME. Loans of u
 p to $5\,000 (minus any unemployment benefits received by borrower) may be
  available and up to three loans to any one borrower can be applied for\, 
 one per each 30-day period.\nIn addition\, FAME has partnered with the Uni
 ted States Small Business Administration (SBA) to offer different loan pro
 ducts to Maine based business who have experienced interruption or hardshi
 p due to COVID-19. The superintendent encourages lenders to evaluate the 
 new programs as they endeavor to help Maine’s consumers and businesses.\
 nFor more information\, please contact FAME.\nhttps://www.maine.gov/pfr/fi
 nancialinstitutions/news-notices/2026-06-10-superintendent-lafountain-noti
 fies-financial-institutions-new-fame-loan
URL:https://www.maine.gov/pfr/financialinstitutions/news-notices/2026-06-1
 0-superintendent-lafountain-notifies-financial-institutions-new-fame-loan
CATEGORIES:Maine Agencies
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
